            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d3293d' fontsize='14'>Newly Onboarded Vendor Performance - Upto 60 days from online</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='10'>All new online accounts in a week belong to that weeks cohort</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
